[[0,1058558,0,4,1,3,"2016-05-23T07:55:02","Javik2186","",[],"<p>I really love playing World of Tanks. Dominating the battlefield with my Tiger II, but the multiplayer is really awful. When I play a match with my tier V T-34 medium tank. I get tossed into a match with way higher tiers than my own. Everyone is tier VII or higher, while I'm the one V on the bottom of the screen. I've asked around on the forums to change the multiplayer to have it where you can choose what Tanks & Tiers you can fight against, only to be mocked and told \"that won't work\" or \"it won't make it fair\". Who cares if it's fair or not? Have some fun with it, be a Tier X German Maus tank vs a bunch of Tier VIII Russian IS-3s. Really, dropping a bunch of low tier players of 4s into a match of Tier 7 & 8 is not fair. I wish WarGaming would pull their heads out from their behinds and fix the multiplayer from being random to where the player can choose what map, tier, and tank can play and make it more open for others to enjoy. </p>\n<p>The players on that game are complete idiots. They all go one side of the map and get massacred, while I go around and win the game for them. When I call for help or assistance fire, they ignore it and rush the much larger and armored tank and get destroyed. Why the micro-transactions? How about earn gold through missions against AI enemy tanks instead of paying WarGaming $30 plus tax for gold?</p>","I fucking hate the multiplayer on World Of Tanks! ","","GameRage"],[1,5279050,0,1,1,0,"2016-05-23T08:49:56","DrBunsen","",[],"<p>That is Pay2Win baby!</p>"],[1,5279130,0,0,1,-1,"2016-05-23T09:17:48","TAThatBoomerang","",[],"<p>War Thunder. </p>"]]
